<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39633" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pūrĭfĭco</span></b> ,
			āvi, ātum, 1, v. a.
		purus-facio, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to make clean</i>, <i>to cleanse</i>,
				<i>purify</i> (postAug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">luteos pedes aquā,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					30, 11, 28, § 93</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tunicas (oculorum) lacrimationum salivis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					11, 37, 54, § 147</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">favum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					21, 14, 49, § 83</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">agrum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell. 19, 12, 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">regnum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Just.
					10, 3, 2</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>to purify with
				religious rites</i>, <i>to expiate</i>, <i>atone for</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">se a concubitu mariti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Aug. 94</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">se,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin. 8,
					1, 1, § 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quod ille infamavit, te purifica,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lampr. Alex. 7</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Paul. Nol. Carm. 6,
			72</span></i>.—Of animals, <i><span class="en">Plin. 10,
				41, 57, § 116</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
